From ee34082a005315fcbbd3d0b276496d70d687b464 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:00:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let GraphQL message subscriptions choose the session resource

stanza.subscribeForMessages opens a session with a random 'sse-<uuid>'
resource that the client never learns, so the session can't be used as
the full JID in other commands, e.g. muc.enterRoom, and messages for a
known full JID can't reach the stream.

Add an optional 'resource' argument to the user and admin
subscriptions. A resource that is already in use returns the
'resource_conflict' error instead of taking over the existing session.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETaRHXo1LmPHqZB9SXMucM
